<title>USA: Diebold stock gains on stock split.</title>
<headline>Diebold stock gains on stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH CANTON, Ohio</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of Diebold Inc. rose Thursday after the maker of transaction and security systems said its board of directors declared a three-for-two stock split.</p>
<p>Diebold was up $1.625 to $58.625 on the New York Stock Exchange in afternoon trading.</p>
<p>The company said shareholders will receive one additional share for each two shares, payable on Feb. 19 to shareholders of record Feb. 7 and it said.</p>
<p>The stock split is the fourth stock split the company has declared in the past five years, it said.</p>
